WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:06.820
Well, five things that maybe do make me really happy, first of all my family.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.780
That's the base, so to speak.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.920
Something that makes me happy besides my family, music.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:24.600
Which is, let's say, my main bridge in life, besides family, music, film.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.280
And being able to, having the chance to capture beautiful moments,

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.080
that's something that makes me very happy, really happy.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.700
Meeting people is also something that makes me really happy,

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:41.020
being able to meet people, connect with new energies every day.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:46.460
And well, the most important thing is being able to share my art,

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.660
or the things I do within art, with the people I meet.
